{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"sChanId":["297"],"sTitle":"🎁 虚狩加冕之时，预约享好礼","sIntro":"亲爱的绳匠，《绝区零》2.5版本「虚狩加冕之时」预约活动现已开启。","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e亲爱的绳匠，《绝区零》2.5版本「虚狩加冕之时」预约活动现已开启。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e游戏内签到活动「虚狩加冕之时」期间，累计登录7日即可获赠480菲林！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e网页内，预约新版本可得320菲林、游戏内纪念道具「小光来信」及称号「与光同行者」！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e参与网页内抽奖活动，更有机会得iPhone、游戏机、手办、菲林等奖励！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e点击预约：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://hoyo.link/JA9qyz3RQ\" data-type=\"a\" link-type=\"game_none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003ehttps://hoyo.link/JA9qyz3RQ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动奖励一览】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003eiPhone 17 Pro Max (512G)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003eXbox Series X 1TB 游戏主机光驱版\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003eXbox无线手柄\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e比利·奇德1/7手办\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e影画系列亚克力插片套组（随机）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e1.「虚狩加冕之时」游戏内活动期间，累计签到7天即可获得480菲林！绳网等级≥8级，在主线序章·幕间中解锁「活动」功能后即可参与游戏内签到活动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2. 前往「虚狩加冕之时」活动网页预约2.5版本，可立得160菲林；绳匠完成预约并在2.5版本更新后登录游戏，还可通过邮件获得160菲林；完成活动网页相关任务，还有机会获得更多好礼！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e3. 网页活动「虚狩加冕之时」将于2025/12/30 05:59:59（UTC+8）结束，游戏签到活动将于2025/12/29 03:59:59（服务器时间）结束，请绳匠及时预约并参与活动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e※更多内容及详细规则请前往活动页面查看。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e※2.5版本开启后，同一页面将开启「集结委托：回归丽都」活动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e邀请好友回归游戏领最高740菲林！ \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161561/bc0aa001db9a75e85482c998c89fc335_1696597051365683419.png\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS-1920×1080.png\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161561/bc0aa001db9a75e85482c998c89fc335_2469688609195379402.png\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-19 20:30:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","sCategoryName":"","sTagName":[],"dtCreateTime":"2025-12-18 15:34:13","iInfoId":161561,"around":{"prevContent":{"sChanId":["295"],"sTitle":"2.5版本「微光引灯时」福利速递","sIntro":"2.5版本「微光引灯时」将于12月30日正式上线，首位双形态代理人-虚狩「叶瞬光」登场！","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2.5版本「微光引灯时」将于12月30日正式上线，首位双形态代理人-虚狩「叶瞬光」登场！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e活动期间，可限时免费领取全新限定S级代理人「照」、「简」全新泳装以及直升40级养成补给，更有1000菲林特殊回馈赠礼，参与签到还可领「加密母带×10」「邦布券×10」~参与累充活动「点映返礼」更有S级代理人及S级音擎9选1！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e另外，包括艾莲、柏妮思在内的数名代理人将迎来加强！更多福利内容及获取方式请查询官方公告~\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e参与预约活动，即获得菲林*160；预约玩家2.5版更后登录可再得菲林*160 \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161559/c101810025d9d842254eb0c36cfc6ec8_2204102945665248086.png\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS-1920x1080.png\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161559/319e561567f17bc3316d741a2038c6d4_5369793201377014880.png\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-19 20:32:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2025-12-18 15:14:59","iInfoId":161559,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""},"nextContent":{"sChanId":["295"],"sTitle":"《绝区零》第二季纪念回顾 | 2025卫非云游","sIntro":"「我一定会…带你回家！」","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e云霞岿然，救世济凡。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e逆流寻踪，结交龙宫。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e沉溺旧梦，往事匆匆。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e深渊将至，抉择之时。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「我是绳匠，不管发生什么事…」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「我一定会…带你回家！」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e▼YouTube\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"ttr-video-frame\" data-type=\"youtube\" style=\"margin:10px auto;width:100%;padding-top:56.25%;position:relative;\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QMSccZd_uK0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"display:block;position:absolute;width:100%;height:100%;top:0;left:0;\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"EN-1920.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161569/ad38d2a5ce2f292fac9fb709470b4f49_2516809482915652197.jpg\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-19 19:45:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2025-12-18 21:55:02","iInfoId":161569,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""}},"sSign":""}}